</div>
<div class="txt" style="--align:left;--ls:-0.01em"><p>Pay your utilities and recurring payments using our online banking’s dedicated feature. FACEBANK’s clients may use this feature to send payment orders to our offices for processing in the form of digital checks.</p>
<p>This feature allows our customers to directly send money to the beneficiary’s account within the USA.</p>
</div>
